# `agents.duplicate`

Copy an agent profile to a new id.

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.agents.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `new_id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |
| `to` | `string` |

## Returns

`ScopedMutation` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.duplicate --json '{ "id": "", "new_id": "", "scope": "", "to": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "rust-lane-copy",
  "scope": "project"
}
```
